title: Political Rally
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 6
card-image: img/protest.jpg
go-to: main_rally; sa_disrupt if sa_strength > 180 and not sa_banned and not return_to_normalcy

@sa_disrupt

The Nazi SA has disrupted our rally! Their street troops are preventing us from meeting.

- @police_protect: Call the police to protect our rally.
- @rb_protect: Use the Reichsbanner to protect our rally.
- @both_protect: The police and Reichsbanner should work together to protect our rally.
- @cancel: Cancel the rally.

@police_protect
view-if: spd_prussia == 1
on-arrival: police_protect_success = prussian_police_loyalty * prussian_police_militancy * prussian_police_strength*2 - sa_militancy*sa_strength;
go-to: police_protect_win if police_protect_success >= 0; police_protect_lose if police_protect_success < 0

@police_protect_win
go-to: main_rally

The police successfully protected our rally, so it can go ahead as usual.

@police_protect_lose
on-arrival: strife += 1; new_middle_nsdap += 2; old_middle_nsdap += 2

Unfortunately, the police were unable or unwilling to hold back the SA mob. The Nazis have won this show of strength.

@rb_protect
on-arrival: rb_success = rb_strength*rb_militancy - sa_strength*sa_militancy; strife += 1
go-to: rb_protect_win if rb_success >= 0; rb_protect_lose if rb_success < 0

@rb_protect_win
go-to: main_rally

As a founding party of the Reichsbanner, we can still call on it to aid us. It has successfully protected our rally against the SA! Our meeting can go ahead as usual.

@rb_protect_lose
on-arrival: new_middle_nsdap += 2; old_middle_nsdap += 2; rb_strength -= 50; spd_relation -= 2

Unfortunately, the Reichsbanner was not able to hold back the SA mob, and our reliance on an organization we do not control has been exposed. The Nazis have won this show of strength.

@both_protect
view-if: spd_prussia
choose-if: prussian_police_training > 0
unavailable-subtitle: The loyal sections of the police have never coordinated with the Reichsbanner before.
on-arrival: rb_success = rb_strength*rb_militancy - sa_strength*sa_militancy + prussian_police_loyalty*prussian_police_militancy*prussian_police_strength*2; strife += 1
go-to: both_protect_win if rb_success >= 0; both_protect_lose if rb_success < 0

@both_protect_win
go-to: main_rally

The police and Reichsbanner have successfully protected our rally against the SA! Our meeting can go ahead as usual.

@both_protect_lose
on-arrival: new_middle_nsdap += 2; old_middle_nsdap += 2; rb_strength -= 50; sa_defeated_police_rb += 1

Unfortunately, the police and Reichsbanner were not able to hold back the SA mob. The Nazis have won this show of strength. [? if sa_defeated_police_rb > 1 : this isn't the first time this has happend, we should act against the SA before they grow too strong. ?]


@cancel
on-arrival: new_middle_nsdap += 2; old_middle_nsdap += 2; public_trust -= 2

The SA have won this show of strength, and our retreat has not gone unnoticed.

@main_rally

Mass rallies are a common feature of weimar democracy, especially in the lead-up to an election. What is the primary theme of this rally?

- @wirtschaftsdemokratie: Reform through cooperation between labor and capital, not conflict between them.
- @defending_democracy: Defending democracy and the rule of law against dictatorship from any direction.
- @pacifism: Opposing militarism, secret rearmament, and the glorification of the last war.
- @fiscal_order: Sound finances, a stable currency, and a government business can plan around.
- @womens_rights: Equal rights and equal citizenship for women.
- @local: A mixture of various local and professional concerns that resonate most with the audience.
- @easy_discard

@wirtschaftsdemokratie
on-arrival: new_middle_ddp += 4*(1-dissent); workers_ddp += 2*(1-dissent) if linksliberale_strength > nationalliberale_strength; new_middle_ddp += 3*(1-dissent) if welfare > 0; linksliberale_strength += 5; linksliberale_dissent -= 5; old_middle_ddp -= 1;

Our message of cooperation between labor and capital appeals to the educated middle class and to moderate workers, though committed partisans on either side remain unmoved. [? if welfare > 0 : Our record on social policy has made this message more effective. ?]

@constitution
on-arrival: constitutional_reform += 1; pro_republic += 2*(1 - dissent); new_middle_ddp += 4*(1-dissent) if constitutional_reform >= 3; old_middle_ddp += 2*(1-dissent) if constitutional_reform >= 3; pro_republic += 4*(1 - dissent) if constitutional_reform >= 3;

Our speakers defend the Weimar Constitution and the rule of law against monarchists, authoritarians, and revolutionaries alike. 

[? if constitutional_reform < 3 : Constitutional arguments excite the committed more than the general public. But that may change; part of our task is civic education. ?]
[? if constitutional_reform >= 3 : Since we have consistently made constitutional defense a theme of our campaign, our base is strongly energized by it. ?]

@pacifism
on-arrival: pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent); new_middle_ddp += 3*(1 - dissent) if pacifism >= 3; educated_ddp += 2*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; nationalism -= 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; pazifisten_strength += 4; pazifisten_dissent -= 5; dvp_relation -= 2;

Our speakers denounce secret rearmament and the glorification of militarism, drawing on Quidde's long record as a critic of the officer class.

[? if pacifism < 3 : Given the volume of nationalist sentiment in the country, this message struggles to break through. ?]
[? if pacifism >= 3 : Since we have consistently made pacifism a theme of our campaign, our base is strongly energized by it. ?]

@fiscal_order
on-arrival: old_middle_ddp += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_ddp += 2*(1-dissent); old_middle_ddp += 3*(1-dissent) if inflation < 3; nationalliberale_strength += 4; nationalliberale_dissent -= 4; dvp_relation += 2;

Our speakers emphasize fiscal responsibility and a stable currency businessmen and professionals alike can plan around. [? if inflation < 3 : Memories of the great inflation still lend this message real force. ?]

@womens_rights
on-arrival: womens_rights += 1; new_middle_ddp += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_ddp += 3*(1-dissent) if womens_rights >= 2; linksliberale_strength += 3; linksliberale_dissent -= 3;

Our speakers, drawing on the party's long record on women's suffrage and civic equality, make the case for full equal citizenship. [? if womens_rights >= 2 : Our record in office lends this message real credibility. ?]

@local
on-arrival: new_middle_ddp += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_ddp += 2*(1-dissent); workers_ddp += 1*(1-dissent);

Our speakers have gauged the mood and are speaking to the local and professional concerns that seem to matter most to this audience.
